Win + I Open Settings Opens the main system settings panel 

Win + X Power User Menu Opens advanced system access menu 

Win + A Quick Settings Opens network, sound, and battery controls 

Win + L Lock Device Immediately locks the workstation 

Win + E File Explorer Opens file management window 

Win + R Run Dialog Opens command execution dialog 

Win + S Search Opens system search interface

Win + D Show Desktop Minimizes all open windows 

Alt + Tab Switch Applications Cycles through open applications 

Ctrl + Shift + Esc Task Manager Opens performance and process monitor 

Shortcut Function Description 

Win + Left Arrow Snap Left Aligns window to left side 

Win + Right Arrow Snap Right Aligns window to right side 

Win + Up Arrow Maximize Expands window to full screen 

Win + Down Arrow Minimize/Restore Reduces window size

Win + Tab Task View Displays all open desktops and windows 

Win + Ctrl + D New Desktop Creates a new virtual desktop 

Win + Ctrl + Left/Right Switch Desktop Moves between virtual desktops 

Win + Ctrl + F4 Close Desktop Closes current virtual desktop





